  m_Name: Penelope
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalEntry
  entryTitle: Penelope
  entryDescription: '''Life is short, so live for yourself.'' No one understood this
    better than Penelope. Life really began to drag when she had gone, which is why
    I really don''t know how to feel about seeing her again.'
